{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54297","headline":"颂 一 · 克符道者","name":"颂 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夺人不夺境，缘自带譊（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「誵」）讹。\n拟欲求玄旨，思量反责麽。\n骊珠光灿烂，蟾桂叶（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「影」）婆[娑]（婆）（从《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》改）。\n觌体（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「面」）无差（《人天眼目》作「回」）互，还应滞网罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}